msgstr "日志消息内容"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-batchsampling.rst:107
#: de2ba78c83ad48569a010f1d36af5d5a
msgid ""
"There are two types of dataflash log messages involved in batch sampling, "
"`ISBH` and `ISBD`."
msgstr "批量采样涉及两种数据闪存日志消息：`ISBH` 和 `ISBD`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-batchsampling.rst:109
#: e83b4e3d71fc4696989ca37ccaaec2df
msgid ""
"`ISBH` is a batch header; it includes a batch number and metadata about the "
"batch."
msgstr "`ISBH` 是批次头部，包含批次号和关于该批次的元数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-imu-batchsampling.rst:110
#: dc416cb68e6b45ffa790afe74d28b86c
msgid ""
"`ISBD` messages contain the actual data for the batch, and reference a "
"header by batch number."
msgstr "`ISBD` 消息包含批次的实际数据，并通过批次号引用头部。"

